Use Convex 1.44.0. The documents table has title, content and an application field createdAt. Five separate mutations insert A, B, C, D, E in that order, with strictly increasing _creationTime. Their createdAt values are 500, 100, 400, 200, 300 respectively. With no concurrent writes, call this query three times with numItems: 2: first cursor:null, then each preceding result's continueCursor.

```ts
import { query } from "./_generated/server";
import { v } from "convex/values";
import { paginationOptsValidator, paginationResultValidator } from "convex/server";
export const candidate = query({
  args: { paginationOpts: paginationOptsValidator },
  handler: async (ctx, args) => ctx.db.query("documents")
    .order("desc").paginate(args.paginationOpts),
});
```
